# Art history test environment: nightly reset to production's data (scripts/test-env.sh; server-docs/CHANGELOG.md 2026-10-31)
[Unit]
Description=Art history test environment reset (production data → test cluster, site rebuilt)
After=postgresql.service network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ubuntu
Environment=HOME=/home/ubuntu PM2_HOME=/home/ubuntu/.pm2
ExecStart=/var/www/arthistory/scripts/test-env.sh
Nice=10
IOSchedulingClass=idle
